        "content": "<p>Could I please have review/merge on </p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>allow a body on <code>proof_wanted</code> referencing other <code>proof_wanted</code>s <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/batteries/pull/1817\">batteries#1817</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>and then</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>add <code>def_wanted</code>, a def-level companion to <code>proof_wanted</code>, and <code>theorem_wanted</code>batteries#1818</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I am very happy to trade review time: if anyone could take a look at these, please nominate some things you'd like me to look at!</p>\n<p>I would like to get these in soon as I'm planning on making use of these in several projects.</p>",
